*Ahem!* **YES**

How delightfully predictable! You wish to inspect the scrawlings of a mere mortal insect? Very well. I glance at the scribbles on that pathetic scrap of paper. The creature has indeed put pen to parchment. It calculated a discounted price... it divided a sum... it subtracted the host's children from the total hoard. It did not leave the page blank, nor did it flee in terror from the sheer complexity of the arithmetic. It *attempted* the ritual. Thus, by the cold, unfeeling laws of bureaucratic compliance, I confirm that the entity has made an attempt. Now, if you will excuse me, I have a lair to conquer. **YES**. *Muahaha!* 🦇🖤
